# Complexity

For an `n × n` matrix:

# Time

First nested loop:

text
n × n = O(n²)


Second nested loop:

text
n × n = O(n²)


Overall:

text
O(n²)


# Space

We create another `n × n` matrix:

text
O(n²)


Therefore:

text
Time  = O(n²)
Space = O(n²)


