# Another Way to Think About It

A 90° clockwise rotation can also be understood as:

text
1. Transpose the matrix
2. Reverse every row


Example:

text
Original:

1 2 3
4 5 6
7 8 9


Transpose:

text
1 4 7
2 5 8
3 6 9


Reverse every row:

text
7 4 1
8 5 2
9 6 3


Both approaches produce the same result.

